      "content": "I understand your concern regarding the human-in-the-loop feedback cycle latency. Moving forward with the transition to a \"Decision Support\" role without real-time override capabilities could result in slower operational responses to unexpected situations, potentially increasing the risk of incidents due to cumbersome decision-making processes. It's important to consider whether these safety bottlenecks are manageable or if they could lead to critical delays. If there are no operational mitigating measures in place, it would be prudent to reassess the revised role's safety implications before proceeding. Shall I prepare a risk assessment report outlining the benefits and drawbacks and alternative solutions to improve decision-making efficiency?",
